# type(scope): resume imperatif (50 chars max)
#
# Types : feat fix refactor perf test docs build ci chore security revert
# Scopes : auth tenants elections voting results members audit platform
#
# Corps optionnel (expliquer le POURQUOI, pas le COMMENT)
#
# Footer optionnel : BREAKING CHANGE: ...
#
# Exemples :
#   feat(auth): add invitation-based account activation
#   fix(tenants): enforce organization scope on member queries
#   security(db): add tenant isolation policies
#   test(voting): cover duplicate submission attempts
#
# REGLES :
# - Imperatif (add, fix, update - PAS added, fixed, updated)
# - Pas de point final
# - Aucune mention d outil IA
